<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Heavy rain relieves central Australia drought.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Heavy rain relieves central Australia drought.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Widespread heavy monsoon rains in February removed most pre-existing rainfall deficiencies in northern and central Australia, the Bureau of Meteorology said on Friday.</p>
<p>Serious to severe deficiencies for an 18-month period ending February remained only in a small area to the northeast of Giles near the southwest Northern Territory-Western Australian border, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
